</ul><h1>Still Game?</h1><p>One time when we sold these previously, <a href="/@zippyus">@zippyus</a> said:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>love this meh. more quirky and accessible card games for kids and adults please!</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Now, <a href="/@zippyus">@zippyus</a> made a very simple mistake here. They failed to specify what they meant by us selling ‘more quirky and accessible card games.’ Like, did they want an even wider variety of different quirky and accessible card games? Or just a greater number of sales featuring quirky and accessible card games, even if said quirky and accessible card games are the same quirky and accessible card games we’ve offered previously?</p>
<p>At any rate, those who visit regularly know which path we decided to take.</p>
<p>But, to be fair, unlike certain things we offer again and again and again and again, people seem to actually enjoy these.</p>
